component if_condition_access
conflict m cg read sib read
banks m 2
assign m cg read 0
assign m sib read 1
component while_condition_access
conflict m cg read sibling read
banks m 2
assign m cg read 0
assign m sibling read 1
component while_condition_dependence
banks m 1
assign m ccond read 0
assign m wbody write 0
dep m waw wbody write wbody write
component main
